          "NlmCategory": "BACKGROUND",
          "Label": "INTRODUCTION",
          "content": "The nucleopathy calcifying of the inter vertebral disk is mostly asymptomatic."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
          "Label": "CASE RECORD",
          "content": "We report a cave miming a spondylodiscit."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "DISCUSSION",
          "content": "Although idiopatic in most case, it is necessary to look for a calcifying metabolic disease. The treatment base on the immobilization of the spine and non steroidal anti inflammatory medications."
